{
  "name": "02 \u2014 FB Messenger Chatbot v2 (RAG + Order + Lead + Support)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 2 v2 \u2014 FB Messenger Chatbot (clean flow)\n\n**Flow:**\nWebhook -> Respond 200 OK -> Extract (psid, mid, text) -> Audio?/STT -> Get User -> Get Products -> Build Context -> Dedup IF (mid != memory.last_mid AND ai_enabled) -> Detect Intent (Code/IF) -> Switch into 4 branches:\n* qa      -> Pinecone Retrieve + Gemini Embeddings -> Chat reply\n* order   -> Order Flow (Code/IF) -> Save Order? -> Append Orders\n* lead    -> Format Lead Reply -> Upsert Leads sheet\n* support -> Format Support Reply -> Telegram Alert\n...all branches -> Merge Reply -> Update User memory -> Send FB Reply.\n\n**Rules respected:**\n* Users / Orders / Leads are direct Sheets read/write nodes, NEVER AI Agent tools.\n* Pinecone holds only Products + Setup knowledge (namespace 'knowledge').\n* Order flow is deterministic Code/IF.\n* Replies are short Bangla/Banglish (1-2 sentences).\n* mid-based dedup prevents double-processing FB retries.\n\n**Setup:** Replace REPLACE_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID, REPLACE_FB_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN, REPLACE_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI, Google Gemini, Pinecone, Telegram Bot. Webhook path: /fb-messenger-rag.",
